              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe kuntu amatungo yābagirana! Amasho y’inka aragangaraye, kukw ahebuye ubgatsi; mbere n’imikuku y’intama iragowe.",
          "type": "text",
